    "\"It read that out of the design doc. Point it at the actual retry module — work from the primary source when the behaviour matters.\"": "“它是从设计文档里读到的。把它指向实际的重试模块——行为很重要时，要依据一手来源工作。”",
    "\"The agent says the retry logic backs off exponentially, but I'm watching it hammer the endpoint.\"": "“智能体说重试逻辑采用指数退避，但我看到它正在不断轰炸端点。”",
    "A source of truth in its original form — the code, the conversation transcript, the raw log, the actual API response. Not an account of the thing; the thing. Counterpart to secondary source.": "一手来源是原始形式的事实来源，例如代码、对话记录、原始日志和实际 API 响应。它不是对事物的转述，而就是事物本身。它的反义概念是<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/secondary-source\">二手来源</a>。",
    "If you want to know what your codebase does, the code is the primary source. The docs, the architecture diagram, and the README are all descriptions of it — accurate when written, on their own schedule ever since. When an agent confidently asserts something wrong about your project, the question to ask is which source it was working from: an agent that read a doc inherits the doc's staleness; an agent that read the code is reading the current truth.": "如果想知道代码库实际做什么，代码就是一手来源。文档、架构图和 README 都只是描述——它们在写成时可能准确，之后却各自按照自己的节奏变化。当<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agent\">智能体</a>自信地对项目作出错误断言时，应该先问它依据的是哪种来源：读取文档的智能体会继承文档的过时状态；读取代码的智能体则是在读取当前事实。",
    "Reach for the primary source when precision matters — the exact signature, the actual error, the line that throws. Much of managing context is deciding when to pay for the primary source and when a secondary source is good enough.": "当精确性重要时，应直接查阅一手来源——准确签名、实际错误、真正抛出异常的代码行。上下文管理的很大一部分，就是决定何时值得为一手来源付出成本，何时二手来源已经足够。",
    "The cost is what keeps primary sources from being the default. Loading one into the context window is expensive — the full file, the full transcript, every token billed as input and competing for attention budget. What you get for the cost is completeness: nothing has been pre-filtered by someone else's judgement about what mattered. A summary written last month can't contain the detail that turned out to matter today; the primary source still does.": "成本使一手来源无法成为默认选择。把一手来源加载进<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context-window\">上下文窗口</a>代价高昂——完整文件、完整对话记录，每个 <a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/token\">Token</a> 都会作为输入计费，并争夺<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/attention-budget\">注意力预算</a>。换来的价值是完整性：没有任何内容预先经过他人对“什么重要”的判断而被过滤。上个月写的摘要不可能包含今天才显得重要的细节，而一手来源仍然包含。",
    "Usage:": "<em>用法：</em>"
  },
